*A Simple MOSFET Gain Stage. AC Analysis.

M1 3 2 0 0 nmos w=4u l=1u 
Rsource 1 2 100k
Rload 3 vdd 25k

Vdd1 vdd 0 5 
Vin 1 0 1.44 ac .1 sin(0 1 1e+5 0 0) 

*.options noacct
.ac dec 10 100Hz 1000MegHz 

.model nmos nmos level=9

.print AC format=csv file=output.csv precision=17 IR(vdd1) II(vdd1) IR(vin) II(vin) VR(1) VI(1) VR(2) VI(2) VR(3) VI(3) VR(vdd) VI(vdd)
.end
